/* Rounds FLOAT_AT(MEM32(esi)) times ebx+0x4C into a fire interval, and when WeaponFireCheck accepts the
   shot, subtracts the interval from esi+0x14, builds a transform through SceneObjectGetAttachedTransform
   and MatrixGetHeadingPitchRoll, creates the flare GameObject with GameObjectCreate and sets ebx+0x50. */
